**MDM — the Monetisation Dot-to-Dot Mandala.**

Most business plans contain a small number of linked assumptions.

The frontier AI plan contains an ecosystem.

That is why executives increasingly describe AI not as a product but as infrastructure, electricity, an operating system, a new industrial revolution or the foundation of the global economy.

A product can fail its margin target.

A civilisational substrate merely requires another funding round.

